    // ---- the host's checks (P8, DESIGN section 8) ---------------------------------------------------------------------
    // Each player's game decides its own hits and moves (no waiting on the host); the host checks what it is told:
    //   - rate limits per player: chat 6 lines then 1.2 / s; requests (items, spawn points, beds, seats, admin, teams,
