    //   - a PvP hit ("ph" = victim|damage x 100): PvP on; damage 0..PVP_DMG_MAX; the shooter within PVP_RANGE of the
    //     victim at some moment of the last LAG_MS (both players' recent places: lag compensation). Else dropped + noted
    //   - moves: over 2 s or more, faster than MOVE_MAX px/s (a car tops out near 270 px/s) is noted, except while the
    //     player was hidden (dead, in a vehicle), just joined (40 s), was moved by an admin (8 s), died or used a spawn
